    <published>2026-09-30T16:00:00.000Z</published>
    <summary>讨论工业 AI 落地时，为什么打光能力比算法更少被提及，却往往决定了项目成败。</summary>
    <title>工业视觉质检的壁垒到底在哪里</title>
    <updated>2026-10-04T16:39:41.382Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>白云苍狗</name>
    </author>
    <category term="记录类" scheme="https://awk001.github.io/categories/%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E7%B1%BB/"/>
    <category term="Python" scheme="https://awk001.github.io/tags/Python/"/>
    <category term="PySide6" scheme="https://awk001.github.io/tags/PySide6/"/>
    <category term="调试" scheme="https://awk001.github.io/tags/%E8%B0%83%E8%AF%95/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>界面偶尔卡一下，测试的时候偶现，开发者本机完全复现不了。这种问题最耗人。</p><h2 id="先排除错误的方向"><a href="#先排除错误的方向" class="headerlink" title="先排除错误的方向"></a>先排除错误的方向</h2><p>遇到卡顿，第一反应往往是「加点 sleep 让它等等」。这是最坏的开端。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-comment"># 错误示范</span><br>QTimer.singleShot(<span class="hljs-number">500</span>, <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.refresh_data)  <span class="hljs-comment"># 假装没看见竞态</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这不解决任何问题，只是把概率性的时序冲突变成稳定复现。真正的竞态还在那里，只是被推迟了，日后会在更难查的地方冒出来。</p><h2 id="二分法定位"><a href="#二分法定位" class="headerlink" title="二分法定位"></a>二分法定位</h2><p>我的做法是给链路加时间戳，而不是加延迟：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> time<br><br>_t0 = time.perf_counter()<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">log_step</span>(<span class="hljs-params">name: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>:<br>    elapsed = (time.perf_counter() - _t0) * <span class="hljs-number">1000</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&#x27;[perf] <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;name:32s&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;elapsed:<span class="hljs-number">8.2</span>f&#125;</span> ms&#x27;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在每个环节前后各打一次。跑二十次，看输出的分布而不是单次结果——偶发问题看的是尾部，不是均值。</p><p>这一步抓到的问题在：设备数据采集的回调里，触发了 UI 线程的同步刷新。</p><h2 id="根因"><a href="#根因" class="headerlink" title="根因"></a>根因</h2><p>回调可能在工作线程上被触发，也可能被 <code>QMetaObject.invokeMethod</code> 切回主线程。两条路径都会走到同一个刷新函数，而其中一条是重入的。</p><p>修法不是加锁，是明确线程归属：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-meta">@Slot(<span class="hljs-params"><span class="hljs-built_in">object</span></span>)</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">on_device_data</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, payload: DeviceData</span>) -&gt; <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;保证只在主线程执行。&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> QThread.currentThread() <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.thread():<br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 不在这里判断后再调用，直接转发，</span><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 避免 TOCTOU 竞态</span><br>        <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.invokeMethod(<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">lambda</span>: <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>.on_device_data(payload),<br>            Qt.ConnectionType.QueuedConnection,<br>        )<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span><br><br>    current = <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>._current_row<br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 已有有效数值就跳过，不让合格判定覆盖已写入的数据</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> current.has_valid_value():<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span><br><br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">self</span>._fill_row(current, payload)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="教训"><a href="#教训" class="headerlink" title="教训"></a>教训</h2><ol><li><strong>偶发问题看分布，不看单次。</strong> 单次日志只能证明「这次没问题」。</li><li><strong>不要用 sleep 掩盖时序问题。</strong> 它把问题藏起来，不是修掉。</li><li><strong>线程归属要在入口统一，不要在每一处判断。</strong> 分散的 <code>if</code> 判断迟早会漏一处。</li></ol>]]>
    </content>
